                    {
                        "form_id": "a212961c-4e29-44bb-9d5c-f59453402494",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "rouleuse"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "21a0ff33-e758-3495-82cb-f39b7b243f4e",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui fait rouler."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8df86dd4-0302-4bd3-8cec-44ae4a0602f3",
                                "sense_id": "21a0ff33-e758-3495-82cb-f39b7b243f4e",
                                "text": "La tempête a béni mes éveils maritimes.\nPlus léger qu’un bouchon j’ai dansé sur les flots\nQu’on appelle rouleurs éternels de victimes,\nDix nuits, sans regretter l’œil niais des falots !"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2640bc16-7ba3-3cb2-91b0-8f5bbba640b6",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Celui qui avance en véhicule."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa0c07e8-02f0-4115-9954-37777e764ef0",
                                "sense_id": "2640bc16-7ba3-3cb2-91b0-8f5bbba640b6",
                                "text": "Jean-Louis, 70 ans, un ancien rouleur (qui transportait le minerai en camion), est né en Nouvelle-Calédonie mais fait partie de ces vieilles familles caldoches arrivées sur le territoire depuis des générations."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e5554aa1-d7b3-38e6-93d5-38bafd06930a",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ouvrier qui déplace des tonneaux en les faisant rouler. Ouvrier qui déplace des charges avec une brouette, un chariot à main, etc."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d1a701a3-7fa8-45c5-8a64-6804afc92807",
                                "sense_id": "e5554aa1-d7b3-38e6-93d5-38bafd06930a",
                                "text": "Le club des Rouleurs de barriques de Lussac-Saint-Émilion a repris le flambeau d’une tradition séculaire qui est apparue chez les tonneliers de Bordeaux."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8cd8ebd6-01ab-46f8-b8fa-29a9c48d89ce",
                                "sense_id": "e5554aa1-d7b3-38e6-93d5-38bafd06930a",
                                "text": "Un tonneau échappé à son rouleur faillit fracasser les pattes de leur cheval et déclencher une rixe."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c6bdf087-82f6-314c-9146-0a3467980548",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ouvrier chargé de pousser les wagonnets de charbon dans une mine."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Mine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "50482795-74f1-438a-9e66-a59b5a1c5231",
                                "sense_id": "c6bdf087-82f6-314c-9146-0a3467980548",
                                "text": "L’oncle Gaspard était piqueur, c’est-à-dire qu’au moyen d’un pic, il abattait le charbon dans la mine ; Alexis était son rouleur, c’est-à-dire qu’il poussait, qu’il roulait sur des rails dans l’intérieur de la mine, depuis le point d’extraction jusqu’à un puits, un wagon nommé benne, dans lequel on entassait le charbon abattu ; arrivée à ce puits, la benne était accrochée à un câble qui, tiré par la machine, la montait jusqu’en haut."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "46390e9e-84aa-30b4-842d-b878030ee35c",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Ouvrier qui change souvent d’employeur, de lieu de travail."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7fab2300-c055-46ce-b88c-b01b138972c8",
                                "sense_id": "46390e9e-84aa-30b4-842d-b878030ee35c",
                                "text": "Ce valet à l’ancienne mode, peut-être un rouleur comme moi, qui avait, à la fin, trouvé sa place, il était de la famille, plus que s’il en avait eu le sang et la chair."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "41037d7d-d64d-305b-97e3-8ee2dedae7de",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Charançon de la vigne."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "familiar"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f16c5205-a7d3-4369-b620-00ff3a3fc7c0",
                                "sense_id": "41037d7d-d64d-305b-97e3-8ee2dedae7de",
                                "text": "Le rouleur s’est mis dans nos vignes."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b978f94a-f408-332c-a6c4-58df34174e62",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Navire sujet au roulis."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a4f3aab7-98b3-4ef1-8679-4c73937e386b",
                                "sense_id": "b978f94a-f408-332c-a6c4-58df34174e62",
                                "text": "D'autre part, l'absence de quille et l'étroitesse de la coque rendent ce bateau rouleur et le destinent donc plutôt au cabotage."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cbc93d61-75d6-38b9-ac9b-fd5c97de0b8a",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Cycliste très performant sur les grandes distances."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4bc0d193-d07e-3ad4-80f7-36f413528090",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Gros tambour de l'on place entre les genoux et que l'on frappe avec les deux mains, typique de l'île de La Réunion."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bb251398-47f4-39f9-9a4c-244e80d3a7be",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Appareil de manutention, consistant en une plaque ou un cadre monté sur des roulettes, destiné à déplacer des charges lourdes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "356a99fe-68bb-4655-8dd1-6dea4f0cb84f",
                                "sense_id": "bb251398-47f4-39f9-9a4c-244e80d3a7be",
                                "text": "Un rouleur de fût. Un cric rouleur. Rouleur pour palettes bois et caisses grillagées. Vente de rouleurs de manutention. Garantis 10 ans. Livraison offerte dès 150€."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "60a77237-e670-357f-98f0-9ba5fe3670fa",
                        "entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Définition manquante ou à compléter. (Ajouter)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Touraine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72937e2f-6063-4b7b-a36c-bc4bd48755c9",
                                "sense_id": "60a77237-e670-357f-98f0-9ba5fe3670fa",
                                "text": "Les Compagnons charpentiers fêtent la Saint-Joseph en mars, c’est la fête des Compagnons « reçus ». Précédés du « rouleur » en chapeau haut de forme à large ruban, habit noir, canne rubannée, les Compagnons charpentiers des devoirs défilent chaque année dans les rues de Tours en l’honneur de leur saint patron, saint Joseph. Ils présentent au public les chefs-d’œuvre réalisés dans l’année. Tous portent le « largeot », pantalon de velours noir resserré aux chevilles, et le « coletin », veste pour… coletiner le bois, à laquelle est accroché un ruban de couleur et ils ont la canne du voyageur du Tour de France à la main."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5fbaabc5-4970-4909-af38-a3fb31e64008",
                        "source_entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "source_sense_id": "21a0ff33-e758-3495-82cb-f39b7b243f4e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Celui qui avance en véhicule",
                        "target_lang_word": "Fahrer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Fahrer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f93195f8-fd84-374d-a570-62e4ab2e38e2",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9a7c7d-0ad0-3a55-911c-3618b03f57fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die ein Fahrzeug steuert, lenkt, bedient oder fährt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebcbf50c-602b-4904-b3bc-f03ede0ea8a2",
                                                "sense_id": "f93195f8-fd84-374d-a570-62e4ab2e38e2",
                                                "text": "Der Fahrer des Wagens mit dem Kennzeichen … wird gebeten, sein Fahrzeug zu entfernen; es blockiert die Zufahrt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9fdd448a-6e87-4dc8-9f73-84b4d44a7d6c",
                                                "sense_id": "f93195f8-fd84-374d-a570-62e4ab2e38e2",
                                                "text": "„Dabei sieht Hackenberg das autonome Fahren vornehmlich als Hilfsangebot, um den Fahrer vor folgenreichen Fehlern zu schützen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d04c496c-cdf9-4284-a670-9b432b18482d",
                                                "sense_id": "f93195f8-fd84-374d-a570-62e4ab2e38e2",
                                                "text": "„‚Viel Glück,‘ sagte der Fahrer, als Augie auf die Straße trat. ‚Eigentlich solltest du schon dafür was kriegen, dass du als erster kommst.‘“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e58576ea-559c-3507-b6c8-647b960dca86",
                                        "entry_id": "ad9a7c7d-0ad0-3a55-911c-3618b03f57fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die als berufliche Tätigkeit ein Fahrzeug steuert, lenkt, bedient oder fährt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65ba40ab-02e2-4f93-8767-c6165c06caa4",
                                                "sense_id": "e58576ea-559c-3507-b6c8-647b960dca86",
                                                "text": "Er jobbt zur Zeit als Fahrer bei einem Kurierdienst."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b0e1a7ee-748e-406e-9700-4ddf7ed47d50",
                                                "sense_id": "e58576ea-559c-3507-b6c8-647b960dca86",
                                                "text": "„Die Fahrer daneben rauchten, warteten geduldig auf die wie üblich schleppende Abfertigung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "529ddd39-ed5c-46df-9441-6dfd97149049",
                                                "sense_id": "e58576ea-559c-3507-b6c8-647b960dca86",
                                                "text": "[Fahrradrennen:] „Die aerodynamischen Verbesserungen an Rad, Kleidung und Position führen dazu, dass die Fahrer bei gleichen Geschwindigkeiten weniger Kraft aufwenden müssen als etwa vor zehn Jahren.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "dcb5194d-1da7-4b9b-ae4b-714f52a8bad8",
                        "source_entry_id": "8418849d-cc75-3f5c-a82d-4c6cb7667a23",
                        "source_sense_id": "21a0ff33-e758-3495-82cb-f39b7b243f4e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Celui qui avance en véhicule",
                        "target_lang_word": "driver",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "driver",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7be12f1-f495-3697-a335-b360e8de1738",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af4b279f-791f-4367-9571-14a34e0da499",
                                                "sense_id": "b7be12f1-f495-3697-a335-b360e8de1738",
                                                "text": "Luke North was working in the North East District when Harry Patterson the pony driver came by. It was 5.45 o'clock. Luke smelt danger in the air. He walked round the pony to speak with Harry […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something.",
                                            "A person who drives a motorized vehicle such as a car, truck, bus, train, forklift, etc."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f6df3521-6c1f-4a5f-856f-d8578339c7c9",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "The driver will make an announcement when the trip is nearing its completion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91315f68-dc0d-414b-bea5-92a655a4cb3c",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "Tipping your driver is optional but is much appreciated."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4648b252-0c15-45e4-aad2-9066894920f8",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "That’s nearly twice the highest posted speed limit in the United States, 85 mph, on a stretch of highway in Texas. Why do our speedometers stretch to a speed that’s illegal, and only race-car drivers will ever reach?\nToyota spokesman Paul Hogard said the automaker wants speedometers to be easy to read, so there’s value in placing the typical operating speed of American cars, 45 mph to 70 mph, he said, at the top of the speedometer, which is the easiest place on the speedometer for the driver to read."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b0967a4-24f3-4d7d-8bc9-f66adb1bcce3",
                                                "sense_id": "69eaf33e-a47c-3fb0-9a3d-6aa7eadad792",
                                                "text": "Earlier this month, the National Highway Traffic Safety Administration began an investigation into four crashes of Teslas operating with a partial-automation system (which can navigate highways and steer the car on city streets but requires a licensed driver to be present), including one in which a pedestrian was killed. In a news release, NHTSA said reduced visibility may have led to the crashes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8fd06985-c3dd-3722-b7c6-fc07560ac14f",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something.",
                                            "A pilot (person who flies aircraft)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "70759870-c452-3c41-a1de-436e66481b75",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who drives something.",
                                            "A person who drives livestock: a drover."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8f4c7a5-aaa3-41a6-a140-bc45e9e3e980",
                                                "sense_id": "70759870-c452-3c41-a1de-436e66481b75",
                                                "text": "Up until 1872 there was not over 150 miles of railroad in the state [Texas], that was from Galveston to Houston, and a short line from Houston to Brazoria, twenty-five miles in length, and one road from Harrisburg to Alton, three miles east of Columbus. So the cattle driving to Kansas was the only hope at that time, and it proved to be a great help before the railroads got around. Trail driving to Kansas lasted from 1866 to 1886 and it was estimated that fully eight million head of cattle and horses were driven and sold during the twenty years above mentioned to Kansas, the drivers paying for the cattle on an average of $10.00 per head, although most of the horses came back to Texas and were used the next year. There were all sizes of herds from five hundred to twenty-five hundred cattle in a drove, usually seven or eight men to the small herds and twelve to fifteen men with the large herds."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1bed48ee-8313-39cb-867a-535a87b25d71",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "60619b33-35b4-41e1-a0a4-bbf8e4797fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "1bed48ee-8313-39cb-867a-535a87b25d71",
                                                "text": "The character of work is a driver of social change, at the same time that any new forms of work are the result of broader social change."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e6a05f6f-c146-490f-8a34-d91fd7f5f54e",
                                                "sense_id": "1bed48ee-8313-39cb-867a-535a87b25d71",
                                                "text": "The aim is to secure up to £140 million for the combined road and rail improvements, including a new road bridge to replace a level crossing at Totton. A key driver has been the approval of a new housing and employment development called Fawley Waterside, with 1,500 homes planned on the site of a redundant power station on the edge of Southampton Water."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "561e630d-f9c6-391b-8f83-3f1f60650d97",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A device driver; a program that acts as an interface between an application and hardware, written specifically for the device it controls."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "734203fb-051b-3307-b510-1193fc3999cf",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A golf club used to drive the ball a great distance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbeb1cde-8a28-443d-b126-2bba49efe99c",
                                                "sense_id": "734203fb-051b-3307-b510-1193fc3999cf",
                                                "text": "The brassey much resembled the driver, but the iron opened out quite a new field of practice; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d12b6f1-0db0-364e-a837-79602fea2d06",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A kind of sail, smaller than a fore and aft spanker on a square-rigged ship, a driver is tied to the same spars."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69fa2673-17af-37d5-b942-697c30c4543f",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A factor contributing to something; a cause."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd38e520-9db6-4280-9c2e-38a8f9e9ead0",
                                                "sense_id": "69fa2673-17af-37d5-b942-697c30c4543f",
                                                "text": "Compared with June 2023, consumers’ perceptions of the main drivers of inflation shifted towards wages, although other input costs were still seen as the strongest driver overall."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ce948cd-e8d5-3ec1-ac08-b79a909517a1",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "Any driving element in any mechanism, which drives the driven element."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a66f73da-8043-47e3-8379-60f1192979e4",
                                                "sense_id": "9ce948cd-e8d5-3ec1-ac08-b79a909517a1",
                                                "text": "The driver engages the follower intermittently, as dictated by the solenoid."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef7b86e8-72a8-3f05-a163-92ca659125be",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A mallet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "02293d3a-b973-3715-8fc8-937bf9cdaf1a",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A tamping iron."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db21e1db-1a71-3581-95fa-faa55546143a",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A cooper's hammer for driving on barrel hoops."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "36c2e962-75b2-318a-b7f6-addfd52985ec",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A screwdriver, a nutdriver, or a bit for such a tool; such bits include nutsetters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa00ab0c-be55-4022-9260-e739bfbd5ea4",
                                                "sense_id": "36c2e962-75b2-318a-b7f6-addfd52985ec",
                                                "text": "Among the driver and screw types available, you'll find several cross-slot varieties including the Reed & Prince […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bee102e1-b9c6-3e05-b837-9634428d8cbd",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A device that converts an electrical signal to sound waves; the principal component of loudspeakers and headphones."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea12ba67-f802-3188-89f6-ffde88a2c51a",
                                        "entry_id": "468645d5-f066-3757-bd63-d49ce69bbdb6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that drives something else.",
                                            "A driving wheel of a locomotive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "in-plural"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9cd488ba-9062-48c0-885d-1691697107c8",
                                                "sense_id": "ea12ba67-f802-3188-89f6-ffde88a2c51a",
                                                "text": "The later iterations of these locomotives had 56-inch drivers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f65dbb5-56fb-41e3-9578-c3ba11d283b1",
                                                "sense_id": "ea12ba67-f802-3188-89f6-ffde88a2c51a",
                                                "text": "With a toot on her chime whistle, No. 6 set her 3 ft. 9 in. drivers turning and we were off round the curve through Pennyburn works."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
